1. e4 e6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 dxe4 5. Nxe4 Be7 6. Bxf6 gxf6 7. Nf3 a6 $5 (7... Nd7 8. Qd2 $6 f5 9. Ng3 h5 $5 10. h4 Bd6 11. Rh3 c6 12. Ng5 Nf6 13. Bc4 Nd5 $15 {Euwe,M-Balla,Z/Bad Pistyan 1922/½-½ (50)}) (7... c6 $6 8. Qd2 f5 9. Ng3 b6 10. Bc4 Nd7 11. O-O-O Bb7 12. Rhe1 Nf6 13. Kb1 Qc7 14. Ne5 $16 {Kozma,J-Fichtl,J/CSR-ch Prague 1953 (37)}) (7... Qd5 $6 8. Bd3 Nd7 9. O-O Nf8 10. c4 Qh5 11. Qd2 Rg8 12. Ng3 Qg4 13. Rfe1 Bd7 14. Be4 $36 {Aronson,L-Khanov,K/URS-ch sf 1957/1-0 (49)}) (7... f5 8. Nc3 Bf6 9. Bc4 (9. Qd2 c5 10. d5 (10. Bb5+ Bd7 11. dxc5 a6 12. Bxd7+ Nxd7 13. O-O-O Qc7 14. Qd6 Rc8 15. Nd5 Qxc5 $11 {Sax,G-Lautier,J/Clermont Ferrand 1989}) 10... exd5 11. Qe3+ Be6 12. Qxc5 Nd7 13. Bb5 Rc8 14. Qe3 O-O $13 {Arnason,J-Bjarnason,S/Reykjavik 1989}) 9... Nc6 10. Ne2 O-O 11. c3 b6 12. Nf4 Bb7 13. Qe2 Ne7 14. Nh5 $36 {½-½ Marjanovic,S-Bareev,E/Tirnavia 1989}) 8. g3 ({The most ambitious way to play is} 8. c4 $5 f5 9. Nc3 c5 10. d5 Bf6 11. Qc2 e5 12. O-O-O O-O 13. Nd2 Bg7 14. f3 $14 {with extremly complicated position; Wang Zili-Dreev,A/5th Tan Chin Nam Cup 1999}) (8. Qd2 b5 9. Qh6 $6 Bb7 10. Bd3 Nd7 11. Ng3 f5 12. Nh5 Bf8 13. Qe3 Nf6 $15 {Sutovskij,E-Morozevich,A/Torneo de Pamplona 9th 1998}) (8. Bd3 Nd7 9. Qe2 c5 10. dxc5 Qa5+ 11. Qd2 Qxd2+ 12. Nfxd2 Nxc5 13. Nxc5 Bxc5 $11 {Cohn,E-Swiderski,R/Wien 1908 (62)}) 8... f5 $5 (8... b5 9. Bg2 Bb7 10. Qe2 Bd5 11. Nc3 c6 12. O-O-O Nd7 13. Kb1 Nb6 14. Rhe1 $14 {Leko,P-Morozevich,A/Frankfurt-West Masters 1999}) 9. Nc3 Bf6 ({White got better position after} 9... b5 10. Bg2 Bb7 11. O-O Qd6 12. Ne5 Bxg2 13. Kxg2 O-O 14. Qf3 Ra7 15. Rad1 $14 {Timoshenko,G-Lupu,M/Bucharest ENE 1993 (15)}) 10. Qd2 (10. Qd3 $5) 10... c5 11. d5 O-O 12. O-O-O b5 13. dxe6 $6 {White is playing for a draw and finally manages to make it,but deserved attention} (13. Qe3 Qa5 14. Kb1 $5 (14. Qxc5 $6 Bb7 $1 (14... Nd7 $6 15. Qc6 Nb6 (15... b4 $2 16. Na4) 16. Nd4 $1 {[%cal Gd4b3]} Bd7 17. Qd6 $16 {[%csl Ra5]}) 15. Nd4 $5 Rc8 16. Qd6 Rxc3 $1 17. bxc3 Qxc3 (17... Bxd5 18. Nxe6 $1 Bxe6 19. Bg2 Qxc3 20. Bxa8 Qb2+ 21. Kd2 Qc3+ $13) 18. Nxe6 fxe6 19. Qxe6+ Kg7 20. Qxf5 $13) 14... Rd8 $5 $132 (14... Bxc3 $2 15. bxc3 $1 $16 {[%csl Rg8][%cal Ge3g5]} (15. Qxc3 $2 Qxc3 16. bxc3 Bb7 17. c4 Nd7 18. Bg2 Nb6 $36))) 13... Qxd2+ 14. Nxd2 fxe6 15. Bg2 Ra7 16. Rhe1 $11 (16. f4 $5 Rc7 $1 {[%cal Gb8c6,Gc6d4]} (16... Bb7 17. Bxb7 Rxb7 18. Rhe1 Kf7 19. Nf3 $14 {[%cal Gd1d6]}) (16... Bxc3 $6 17. bxc3 Bb7 18. Bxb7 Rxb7 19. Nf3 $16) 17. Rhe1 Nc6 18. Nf3 Rd8 $11) 16... Rd8 17. Nb3 $5 {For some reason white doesn't want to play f4!} (17. f4 {[%cal Gd2f3]}) 17... Rxd1+ 18. Nxd1 Rc7 19. c3 $5 Kf7 20. Ne3 {[%cal Gf2f4,Gg3g4]} Nd7 21. f4 c4 ({Also after} 21... Bb7 22. Bxb7 Rxb7 23. Rd1 Ke7 24. Nd2 Rb8 25. Nf3 Rd8 26. h3 $11 {the draw is not far away.}) 22. Nd4 Nc5 23. Kc2 Bd7 (23... Bb7 24. Bxb7 Rxb7 25. Nf3 Rd7 26. Rd1 Rxd1 27. Kxd1 $11) 24. g4 Nd3 25. Rf1 Bxd4 26. cxd4 Rc8 27. a3 a5 28. b3 fxg4 1/2-1/2

