{[%mdl 8]} 1. e4 {Hecht} e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bb5 Bc5 4. Nxe5 {Unusual.} Nxe5 {Not the move preferred by theory, but it seems to be quite playable.} (4... Qg5 5. Ng4 (5. Bxc6 dxc6 6. d4 Qxg2 7. Qf3 Qxf3 8. Nxf3 Be7 9. Bf4 Bg4 10. Nbd2 Nf6 $11 {1-0 Zita,F-Foltys,J/Prague 1943/EXT 98 (57)}) 5... Bb6 (5... Qg6 6. O-O d6 7. Ne3 Bxe3 8. fxe3 Nf6 9. d3 $16 {1-0 Magem Badals,J-Carretero Ortiz,F/ESP-chT 1993/TD (31)}) 6. Be2 h5 7. d3 Qg6 8. Ne3 Bxe3 9. Bxe3 Qxg2 10. Bf3 Qh3 11. Nc3 Ne5 12. Be2 d6 13. Nd5 $14 {1-0 Romero Holmes,A-Fernandez Garcia,J/Linares 1991/EXT 2000 (34)}) (4... Nd4 $5 5. Be2 (5. Bc4 Qg5 6. Ng4 d5 7. Bxd5 Bxg4 8. f3 Nxf3+ 9. gxf3 Qh4+ 10. Ke2 Qf2+ 11. Kd3 Bxf3 12. Qf1 Qd4# {0-1 Britton,R-McMahon,D/Sheffield 1996/EXT 98 (12)}) 5... Qg5 6. Ng4 d5 (6... Nxe2 7. Qxe2 h5 8. Ne3 Nf6 9. Nc3 d6 10. h3 Bd7 11. d3 $14 {½-½ Foraboschi,R-Hellmann,E/Trieste 1923/EXT 2000 (57)}) 7. exd5 f5 8. c3 fxg4 9. cxd4 Bd6 10. Bb5+ c6 11. Qe2+ $13 {1-0 Crabbendam,H-Ree,H/Amsterdam 1963/MCD (32)}) (4... Qe7 5. Nf3 Qxe4+ 6. Be2 Nd4 7. Nxd4 Qxd4 8. O-O Nf6 9. c3 Qh4 10. d4 $14 {1-0 De la Villa Garcia,J-Fernandez,J/Palma de Mallorca 1992/TD (100)}) 5. d4 c6 6. Be2 Bd6 $146 {Timman plays the normal move in the position which happens to be a novelty. Black should of course not give up the pair of :s in an open position.} (6... Bb4+ 7. c3 Bxc3+ $2 (7... Bd6 $142) 8. Nxc3 $14 {1-0 Schreiner,M-Mueller,B/Stetten 1988/EXT 97 (43)}) 7. dxe5 Bxe5 8. Nd2 (8. f4 Bc7 9. Nc3 {is more ambitious.}) 8... Bc7 9. Nf3 Ne7 10. O-O O-O 11. Bg5 (11. c4 d5 $11) 11... f6 12. Bh4 d5 $11 {Black has solved his opening problems.} 13. exd5 Qxd5 14. Bg3 (14. Qxd5+ Nxd5 15. Bc4 Be6 16. Nd4 Bf7 17. Nf5 Rfe8 18. Rfe1 Kf8 $11) 14... Bxg3 15. hxg3 Be6 16. Qxd5 Bxd5 17. Rfe1 Rad8 18. Bd3 Ng6 19. Be4 Kf7 20. Bxd5+ Rxd5 21. Rad1 Rfd8 22. Rxd5 Rxd5 {Hecht: '[#] Verirrter weißer Turm.'} 23. Kf1 h5 24. Re3 Ne7 25. Rb3 b6 26. Ke2 c5 27. Rd3 Ke6 28. Re3+ (28. Rxd5 {Hecht} Kxd5 $15) (28. c4 {Hecht} Rxd3 29. Kxd3 Nc6 $15) 28... Kd7 29. c3 Nf5 30. Re4 b5 31. g4 Nd6 32. Rf4 hxg4 33. Rxg4 g5 {'!' Hecht. Hecht: 'Zu den kleineren Raumproblemen kommt nun ein lahmender Turm.'} 34. b3 (34. Nd2 {Hecht} Ke6 (34... f5 35. Rg3 Rxd2+ 36. Kxd2 Ne4+ 37. Kd3 Nxg3 38. fxg3 g4 39. c4 b4 40. a3 a5 41. a4 Ke6 42. b3 Kf6 43. Ke2 $11) 35. Ne4 Re5 36. Kf3 $15) 34... Ke6 $15 {Black has a space advantage.} 35. c4 $6 {Losening.} (35. Nd2 $142 Kf5 36. f3) 35... bxc4 36. bxc4 Rf5 37. Nd2 Re5+ 38. Kd3 Re1 39. Nb3 Kf5 40. f3 Nf7 $17 41. Re4 (41. Nxc5 {Hecht} Ne5+ 42. Kd2 Ra1 $17) 41... Ne5+ 42. Kc3 Rxe4 43. fxe4+ Kxe4 44. Nxc5+ Ke3 $19 45. Kb4 (45. Ne6 {Hecht} g4 (45... Nc6 $5 46. c5 g4) 46. c5 f5 47. Nd4 f4 48. c6 Nxc6 49. Nxc6 f3 50. gxf3 g3 $19) 45... g4 46. Kb5 f5 47. Ne6 f4 48. Ng7 f3 49. gxf3 gxf3 50. Nh5 f2 51. Ng3 Kf3 52. Nf1 Kg2 53. Ne3+ Kg1 0-1

